                'featured_image' => 'blog/blog-bluetooth-speakers.jpg',
                'excerpt'        => 'From beach trips to house parties, a good Bluetooth speaker changes everything. Here are the best portable Bluetooth speakers in India across every budget — from ₹799 to ₹5999.',
                'content'        => '<h2>Why Every Indian Home Needs a Bluetooth Speaker</h2><p>Phone speakers are fine for quick videos, but when you want to fill a room with music, host a small gathering, or take tunes to the beach — a Bluetooth speaker is a game-changer. The good news? You do not need to spend a fortune. Brands like boAt, JBL, Zebronics, and Mivi offer brilliant speakers starting under ₹1000.</p><h2>What Makes a Great Portable Speaker</h2><ul><li><strong>Sound output (watts):</strong> Higher wattage means louder, fuller sound. 5W is fine for personal use, 10W+ for rooms, 20W+ for outdoor gatherings.</li><li><strong>Battery life:</strong> Look for 8+ hours. Some speakers like boAt Stone series offer 12-14 hours.</li><li><strong>Water resistance:</strong> IPX5 or higher if you plan to use it outdoors, near pools, or in the bathroom.</li><li><strong>Size and weight:</strong> Under 500g is pocket-friendly. Larger speakers (1kg+) trade portability for bigger sound.</li><li><strong>Connectivity:</strong> Bluetooth 5.0+, AUX input, and microSD slot give you maximum flexibility.</li></ul><h2>Best Speakers by Use Case</h2><h3>For Travel & Backpacking (Under ₹1500)</h3><p>You need something small, rugged, and long-lasting. Look for speakers under 300g with IPX5+ rating and carabiner clips. Brands like Portronics and Mivi nail this category with compact speakers that survive bumps, dust, and splashes.</p><h3>For Home & Room Use (₹1500-₹3000)</h3><p>Here you want richer sound with deeper bass. 10W-16W speakers with passive radiators deliver room-filling audio. boAt Stone series and Zebronics Zeb-Action are popular choices. Look for TWS pairing so you can connect two speakers for stereo sound.</p><h3>For Parties & Outdoors (₹3000-₹6000)</h3><p>Party speakers need volume, bass, and durability. 20W+ output, LED lights, and microphone input for karaoke make these the life of any gathering. JBL Flip and boAt Stone series in this range are crowd favourites with deep bass and 360-degree sound.</p><h2>Top Brand Breakdown</h2><p><strong>boAt:</strong> Best value for money. Loud bass, trendy designs, long battery. India\'s #1 audio brand.<br><strong>JBL:</strong> Premium sound quality. Balanced audio profile. Slightly pricier but worth it for audiophiles.<br><strong>Zebronics:</strong> Incredible budget options. Great for first-time buyers who want decent sound under ₹1000.<br><strong>Mivi:</strong> Made in India, great build quality, and competitive pricing. Excellent customer service.</p><h2>Speaker Care Tips</h2><p>Even waterproof speakers need care. Dry them off after exposure to water. Do not charge while wet. Store in a pouch during travel. Keep away from direct sunlight for extended periods. And never push volume to 100% constantly — it degrades speaker cones over time.</p><blockquote>A great speaker is one you actually carry everywhere. Pick the right size for your lifestyle, and every moment becomes better with music. Explore our full Bluetooth speaker range at Jikra.</blockquote>',
