            [
                'title'          => '10 Must-Have Car Phone Accessories for Every Indian Driver',
                'slug'           => 'must-have-car-phone-accessories-india',
                'category'       => 'Mounts & Stands',
                'tags'           => ['car phone mount', 'car charger', 'car accessories', 'phone holder car', 'car Bluetooth', 'driving accessories'],
                'featured_image' => 'blog/blog-car-accessories.jpg',
                'excerpt'        => 'From phone mounts to car chargers and Bluetooth adapters, these 10 car phone accessories make every Indian drive safer, more convenient, and more enjoyable.',
                'content'        => '<h2>Your Phone Is Your Co-Pilot</h2><p>For most Indian drivers, the phone has replaced dedicated GPS devices, music systems, and even dashcams. Google Maps for navigation, Spotify for music, and the phone for hands-free calls — your phone does it all while driving. But using it safely requires the right accessories.</p><h2>The Essential 10</h2><h3>1. Car Phone Mount (₹299-₹899)</h3><p>This is non-negotiable. Holding your phone while driving is illegal and dangerous. A good car mount puts your navigation screen at eye level so you can glance at directions without taking your eyes off the road.</p><p><strong>Dashboard mounts:</strong> Stick to your dashboard with adhesive or suction cup. Most stable option.<br><strong>Air vent mounts:</strong> Clip onto your AC vent. Easy to install and remove, but blocks one vent.<br><strong>Magnetic mounts:</strong> A small metal plate inside your phone case snaps to a magnetic mount. Fastest to attach and remove.</p><p><strong>Our pick:</strong> Magnetic mounts for convenience. Just make sure the magnet is strong enough for Indian road bumps.</p><h3>2. Car Charger (₹399-₹999)</h3><p>Navigation + music + Bluetooth calls drain your battery fast. A car charger with fast charging (18W QC or 20W PD) keeps your phone topped up during long drives. Look for dual-port models so your co-passenger can charge too.</p><h3>3. Car Bluetooth Adapter (₹499-₹1299)</h3><p>Older cars without built-in Bluetooth can still stream music wirelessly. A Bluetooth adapter plugs into your car\'s AUX port or cigarette lighter and connects to your phone. Some models even have a built-in mic for hands-free calling.</p><h3>4. USB-C Braided Cable for Car (₹199-₹399)</h3><p>Keep a dedicated 1.5-metre braided cable in your car. Braided cables resist the heat inside parked cars better than rubber cables, and the extra length reaches from the cigarette lighter to any mount position.</p><h3>5. Bike Phone Mount (₹399-₹799)</h3><p>For two-wheeler riders, a handlebar phone mount with rain protection is essential for delivery executives and daily commuters who rely on navigation. Look for mounts with silicone grips and 360-degree rotation.</p><h3>6. Phone Ring Holder / Grip (₹99-₹249)</h3><p>When you pick up your phone from the mount at traffic signals, a ring holder prevents accidental drops. It also doubles as a kickstand for watching content during breaks.</p><h3>7. Car USB Hub (₹499-₹999)</h3><p>Modern cars have one or two USB ports at best. A USB hub expands this to 4-6 ports, letting everyone charge their devices on road trips. Look for hubs that fit in the centre console without dangling.</p><h3>8. Wireless Car Charger Mount (₹999-₹1999)</h3><p>The premium option — a mount that holds your phone AND charges it wirelessly simultaneously. No cable fiddling. Just place your phone, and it starts charging while showing navigation. Compatible with Qi-enabled phones (most modern smartphones).</p><h3>9. Car Perfume / Air Freshener Phone Combo (₹199-₹499)</h3><p>Some clever accessories combine an air vent phone mount with a built-in air freshener capsule. Your car smells great and your phone stays mounted — two problems solved with one accessory.</p><h3>10. Emergency Power Bank (₹699-₹1299)</h3><p>Keep a slim 10000mAh power bank in your glove box for emergencies. Dead phone while stranded means no maps, no calls, no cab booking. A power bank in the car is peace of mind for ₹699.</p><h2>Road Trip Essential Kit</h2><p>For long drives, pack: car charger + mount + USB-C cable + power bank + Bluetooth adapter. Total cost under ₹2000 for a complete setup that makes any drive safer and more enjoyable.</p><blockquote>Safe driving starts with keeping your hands free and your eyes on the road. Shop car phone accessories at Jikra — mounts, chargers, and cables that make every drive better.</blockquote>',
                'is_published'   => true,
                'published_at'   => now()->subDays(6),
                'view_count'     => 734,
                'seo_data'       => [
                    'meta_title'       => '10 Must-Have Car Phone Accessories for Indian Drivers | Jikra Blog',
                    'meta_description' => 'Essential car phone accessories for Indian drivers — car mounts, chargers, Bluetooth adapters & more. Make every drive safer and more convenient. Complete list.',
                ],
            ],

