                'excerpt'        => 'boAt, Noise, and Boult dominate India\'s audio market. But which brand offers the best sound, durability, and value? We compare their earbuds, neckbands, and speakers head-to-head.',
                'content'        => '<h2>The Indian Audio Revolution</h2><p>A decade ago, Indian consumers had two choices for budget audio: expensive international brands or terrible no-name products. Then boAt, Noise, and Boult changed everything. These three brands have collectively sold over 200 million audio products in India, offering quality that rivals international brands at a fraction of the price.</p><h2>boAt: The Bass King</h2><p><strong>Founded:</strong> 2016 by Aman Gupta and Sameer Mehta<br><strong>Known for:</strong> Heavy bass, trendy designs, celebrity collaborations<br><strong>Best products:</strong> Airdopes TWS, Rockerz neckbands, Stone speakers</p><p>boAt is India\'s #1 audio brand by volume. Their signature bass-heavy sound profile appeals to the majority of Indian listeners who love Bollywood, hip-hop, and EDM. Their marketing game is unmatched — from IPL sponsorships to collaborations with artists. Products are widely available and aggressively priced.</p><p><strong>Strengths:</strong> Powerful bass, fast charging (ASAP charge), beast mode for gaming, massive product range, wide availability.<br><strong>Weakness:</strong> Bass can overpower mids and highs in some models. Build quality varies across price ranges.</p><h2>Noise: The Feature Leader</h2><p><strong>Founded:</strong> 2018 by Gaurav Khatri and Amit Khatri<br><strong>Known for:</strong> Feature-packed products, smartwatches, clean sound<br><strong>Best products:</strong> Noise Buds TWS, NoiseFit smartwatches</p><p>Noise has carved its niche by packing more features per rupee than anyone else. Hybrid ANC, quad-mic setups, and Instacharge technology — they consistently push the envelope. Their smartwatches (NoiseFit series) are India\'s top sellers. Sound profile is more balanced compared to boAt, appealing to podcast and audiobook listeners.</p><p><strong>Strengths:</strong> Best ANC at budget prices, excellent call quality (quad-mic), balanced sound, strong smartwatch lineup.<br><strong>Weakness:</strong> Less bass impact compared to boAt. Some models feel plasticky.</p><h2>Boult Audio: The Bass Specialist</h2><p><strong>Founded:</strong> 2017 by Varun Gupta<br><strong>Known for:</strong> Extra-large drivers, deep bass, aggressive pricing<br><strong>Best products:</strong> Boult Z-series TWS, BassBox speakers</p><p>Boult quietly competes with boAt on bass while often undercutting on price. Their 13mm drivers in budget earbuds deliver some of the deepest bass you will hear under ₹2000. They are particularly popular among mobile gamers thanks to low-latency gaming modes.</p><p><strong>Strengths:</strong> Deepest bass in budget segment (13mm drivers), very competitive pricing, good gaming mode.<br><strong>Weakness:</strong> Smaller brand presence, fewer service centres, less diverse product range.</p><h2>Head-to-Head Comparison</h2><p><strong>Sound Quality:</strong><br>Bass: Boult > boAt > Noise<br>Clarity: Noise > boAt > Boult<br>Overall balance: Noise > boAt = Boult</p><p><strong>Build Quality:</strong> boAt = Noise > Boult<br><strong>Features per Rupee:</strong> Noise > Boult > boAt<br><strong>After-sales Service:</strong> boAt > Noise > Boult<br><strong>Design/Style:</strong> boAt > Noise > Boult<br><strong>Gaming Performance:</strong> Boult = boAt > Noise<br><strong>Smartwatch Range:</strong> Noise > boAt > Boult</p><h2>Which Brand Should You Choose?</h2><p><strong>Choose boAt if:</strong> You love bass-heavy music, want trendy designs, value wide availability and service centres, or want the broadest product range.</p><p><strong>Choose Noise if:</strong> You want the best features (ANC, call quality), prefer balanced sound, listen to podcasts and diverse music genres, or also want a smartwatch from the same ecosystem.</p><p><strong>Choose Boult if:</strong> Maximum bass is your priority, you are on a tight budget, or you are primarily a mobile gamer.</p><blockquote>All three brands deliver incredible value. The best brand is the one that matches your audio preference and use case. Shop earbuds, neckbands, and speakers from all three brands at Jikra.</blockquote>',
